Package: lunduke-linux-kernel
Version: 7.2.6-lcos5
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Installed-Size: 28
Maintainer: LCOS <lcos@lunduke.com>
Homepage: https://lunduke.com
Depends: linux-image-7.2.6-lunduke (= 7.2.6-lcos5)
Recommends: linux-headers-7.2.6-lunduke (= 7.2.6-lcos5)
Description: Lunduke's Linux Kernel (optional LCOS overlay)
 Lunduke's Linux Kernel — optional alternate kernel for LCOS.
 .
 Installs linux-image-7.2.6-lunduke (ABI lcos5) alongside the Devuan-supplied
 kernel. Adds a GRUB/boot entry; does not remove or replace the default
 Devuan kernel. Headers are recommended for building out-of-tree modules.
 .
 Not the default kernel in LCOS ISOs. Install only if you want LLK.
